  "id": "b8cce8a35ad7bea254dea84b",
  "title": "寫給你的",
  "summary": "兩千多年前，古希臘哲學家伊比鳩魯（Epicurus）寫過一句話給他的朋友：",
  "content": "<p>兩千多年前，古希臘哲學家<a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/%E4%BC%8A%E5%A3%81%E9%B8%A0%E9%B2%81\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">伊比鳩魯</a>（Epicurus）寫過一句話給他的朋友：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&quot;I write this not for the many, but for you; each of us is enough of an audience for the other.&quot; <sup><a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/i-write-this-for-you#user-content-fn-1-49eed9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1</a></sup></p>\n<p>（我寫這些不是給大眾看的，而是給你看的；我們彼此有對方這個觀眾，就夠了。）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>這個 blog 也是這樣，我是寫給「你」看的；如果是「你」的話，一定懂我這篇是在說「你」吧！</p>\n<p>如果你現在正在想「Wiwi 該不會是在說我吧」，不要懷疑，我就是在說你！</p>\n<p>歡迎對號入座！ 🤣</p>\n\n<h2>Footnotes<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/i-write-this-for-you#footnote-label\" title=\"Footnotes的直接連結\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">​</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>出處：<a href=\"https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Moral_letters_to_Lucilius/Letter_7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Moral_letters_to_Lucilius/Letter_7</a> <a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/i-write-this-for-you#user-content-fnref-1-49eed9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">↩</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
